\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Dataset splits, model portfolio ($K{=}3$), and budget targets. All prompts are sourced from LMSYS Chatbot Arena and judged by DeepSeek-R1. The $500\times $ cost differential between the cheapest and most expensive model stresses the router's quality--cost tradeoff. The three budget targets span the practical operating range between budget-only and frontier-heavy routing; their position relative to model costs determines which arms the pacer can afford to select.}}{9}{table.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dataset}{{1}{9}{Dataset splits, model portfolio ($K{=}3$), and budget targets. All prompts are sourced from LMSYS Chatbot Arena and judged by DeepSeek-R1. The $500\times $ cost differential between the cheapest and most expensive model stresses the router's quality--cost tradeoff. The three budget targets span the practical operating range between budget-only and frontier-heavy routing; their position relative to model costs determines which arms the pacer can afford to select}{table.caption.16}{}}
