\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Failure response across algorithm variants (Experiment\nonbreakingspace 3, 20\nonbreakingspace seeds). Phase\nonbreakingspace 1: normal operation; Phase\nonbreakingspace 2: Mistral-Large catastrophic failure (reward $\to $ 0.05, cost $\to $ \$0); Phase\nonbreakingspace 3: model restored. \textbf  {Bold} marks budget compliance within 5\% of target. ParetoBandit detects the failure, redistributes traffic, and maintains budget compliance; Fixed Policy keeps routing to the dead model. Phase\nonbreakingspace 2 budget ratio may fall below $1.00\times $ because the failed model's cost drops to \$0.}}{15}{table.caption.39}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:failure_response}{{5}{15}{Failure response across algorithm variants (Experiment~3, 20~seeds). Phase~1: normal operation; Phase~2: Mistral-Large catastrophic failure (reward $\to $ 0.05, cost $\to $ \$0); Phase~3: model restored. \textbf {Bold} marks budget compliance within 5\% of target. ParetoBandit detects the failure, redistributes traffic, and maintains budget compliance; Fixed Policy keeps routing to the dead model. Phase~2 budget ratio may fall below $1.00\times $ because the failed model's cost drops to \$0}{table.caption.39}{}}
