\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Cumulative regret curves for selected prior-quality conditions at $n_\mathit  {eff}{=}1{,}000$ (K=3 stationary, 20 seeds, 95\% bootstrap CI). Well-calibrated and domain-mismatched priors separate from Tabula Rasa within the first 200 steps and maintain the advantage throughout. The Inverted prior accumulates excess regret early as the router confidently routes to the wrong model, requiring hundreds of steps to partially recover.}}{31}{figure.caption.99}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:prior_mismatch_regret}{{14}{31}{Cumulative regret curves for selected prior-quality conditions at $n_\mathit {eff}{=}1{,}000$ (K=3 stationary, 20 seeds, 95\% bootstrap CI). Well-calibrated and domain-mismatched priors separate from Tabula Rasa within the first 200 steps and maintain the advantage throughout. The Inverted prior accumulates excess regret early as the router confidently routes to the wrong model, requiring hundreds of steps to partially recover}{figure.caption.99}{}}
